The Other Half (树的另一半) — Colored-Pencil Science Illustration (Lemo-Opuscar) · LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

No AI-generated images, no stock footage, no outside pictures or models: the 3D world (soil, trees, roots, fungus,
stones, worms, grains), the colored-pencil rendering, paper, labels, subtitles and end card are made by the code in this folder.

FONT (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence text in fonts/OFL-lxgwwenkai.txt; the .ttf files are local, fetched by build.sh)
- LXGW WenKai 霞鹜文楷 — The LXGW WenKai Project Authors, based on Klee One (Fontworks) — https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai
  (file: LXGWWenKai-Regular.ttf v1.245.1, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai/v1.245.1/fonts/TTF/LXGWWenKai-Regular.ttf) → fonts/src/, subset by tools/make_font.py → fonts/LXGWWenKai-subset.ttf
