VOICE
- Kokoro TTS (kokoro-onnx, Apache-2.0; model weights Apache-2.0), voice bf_emma, generated locally by
  core/tts/tts.py from voice/lines.json (deterministic; the .wav files are local, in out/voice/).

MUSIC SAMPLES (played by core/audio/sampler.py; out/instruments.txt is written by sampler.credits())
- guitar_nylon, kalimba: FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), CC0 1.0
- flute, clarinet, contrabass_pizz, cellos, violins: VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), CC0 1.0
- harp, glockenspiel, vibraphone_bowed, marimba: Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios), CC0 1.0
Pencil foley, ambience (wind, birds, earth tone), the lens tock and the grain sounds are synthesised by mix.py with core/audio/sfx.py.

